msgstr "Ang application mo para sa %(title)s"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "<strong>Everything is saved as you go.</strong> You can close this page and come back later from My Applications or the link in your verification email."
msgstr "<strong>Automatic na nase-save lahat.</strong> Puwede mong isara ito at bumalik mamaya mula sa My Applications o sa link sa verification email mo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "Jump to your documents"
msgstr "Pumunta sa documents mo"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "<strong>Submit by 11:59 PM on %(day)s</strong> (Philippine time)."
msgstr "<strong>I-submit bago mag-11:59 PM ng %(day)s</strong> (oras sa Pilipinas)."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "After that, unsubmitted applications can no longer be sent."
msgstr "Pagkatapos nito, hindi na puwedeng i-submit ang application na hindi pa tapos."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "Your application was not submitted yet."
msgstr "Hindi pa na-submit ang application mo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "Some answers could not be saved. Everything else was saved."
msgstr "May ilang sagot na hindi na-save. Na-save ang lahat ng iba."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "Please fix these:"
msgstr "Pakiayos ang mga ito:"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "Missing document: %(title)s"
msgstr "Kulang na document: %(title)s"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "1. Your details"
msgstr "1. Ang details mo"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "Email:"
msgstr "Email:"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "Verified"
msgstr "Verified"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "2. About your qualifications"
msgstr "2. Tungkol sa qualifications mo"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_status_lookup.html
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Optional"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "This is the rating your current or last government office gave you (for example an IPCR or SPMS rating). If you haven&rsquo;t worked in government, choose that you don&rsquo;t have one."
msgstr "Ito ang rating na binigay sa iyo ng current o huling government office mo (halimbawa, IPCR o SPMS rating). Kung hindi ka pa nakapagtrabaho sa gobyerno, piliin na wala kang rating."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "3. Your documents"
msgstr "3. Ang documents mo"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "Add each document as a PDF, JPG or PNG (up to %(mb)s MB per file). A document with several pages? Add the pages one by one, or as several photos &mdash; we combine them into one file for the reviewers. Each file is saved the moment it finishes uploading."
msgstr "I-upload ang bawat document bilang PDF, JPG o PNG (hanggang %(mb)s MB bawat file). Maraming pages ang document? I-upload ang pages isa-isa, o picturan isa-isa &mdash; kami na ang magsasama sa isang file para sa mga reviewer. Nase-save agad ang bawat file pagkatapos ma-upload."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "<strong data-doc-ready>%(ready)s</strong> of <strong data-doc-total>%(total)s</strong> required documents ready"
msgstr "<strong data-doc-ready>%(ready)s</strong> sa <strong data-doc-total>%(total)s</strong> required documents ang ready na"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "4. Submit your application"
msgstr "4. I-submit ang application mo"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "Still needed before you can submit:"
msgstr "Kulang pa bago ka maka-submit:"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "After you submit, you can no longer change your application. You&rsquo;ll get a receipt and a tracking code right away."
msgstr "Kapag na-submit mo na, hindi mo na mapapalitan ang application mo. Makakatanggap ka agad ng resibo at tracking code."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "Save and finish later"
msgstr "I-save at tapusin mamaya"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "Submit my application"
msgstr "I-submit ang application ko"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "<strong data-doc-ready-sticky>%(ready)s</strong> of <span data-doc-total-sticky>%(total)s</span> documents ready"
msgstr "<strong data-doc-ready-sticky>%(ready)s</strong> sa <span data-doc-total-sticky>%(total)s</span> documents ang ready na"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_receipt.html recruitment/templates/recruitment/includes/applicant_journey.html
msgid "Documents"
msgstr "Documents"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "Submit"
msgstr "I-submit"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Help &amp; FAQ"
msgstr "Tulong &amp; FAQ"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Help &amp; Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "Tulong &amp; Mga Madalas na Tanong"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Answers to common questions about applying for positions at DOH&ndash;CHD CALABARZON. If you can&rsquo;t find what you need below, the Human Resource Management Unit (HRMU) is happy to help."
msgstr "Mga sagot sa mga madalas na tanong tungkol sa pag-apply sa DOH&ndash;CHD CALABARZON. Kung wala rito ang hinahanap mo, handang tumulong ang Human Resource Management Unit (HRMU)."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Applying for a position"
msgstr "Pag-apply sa position"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Do I need to create an account to apply?"
msgstr "Kailangan ko bang gumawa ng account para mag-apply?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "No. You don&rsquo;t need an account. You only need a valid email address. When you start, we send a 6-digit code to that email; entering it confirms the address and opens your application."
msgstr "Hindi. Hindi mo kailangan ng account. Email address lang ang kailangan. Pagsimula mo, magpapadala kami ng 6-digit code sa email na iyon; kapag nailagay mo ito, confirmed na ang email mo at bubukas ang application mo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Each code works for %(minutes)s minute."
msgid_plural "Each code works for %(minutes)s minutes."
msgstr[0] "Valid ang bawat code nang %(minutes)s minuto."
msgstr[1] "Valid ang bawat code nang %(minutes)s minuto."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Can I save my application and finish later?"
msgstr "Puwede ko bang i-save ang application at tapusin mamaya?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Yes. Your answers are saved as you type, and each document is saved the moment it finishes uploading. You can close the page at any time."
msgstr "Oo. Nase-save ang mga sagot mo habang nagta-type ka, at nase-save agad ang bawat document pagkatapos ma-upload. Puwede mong isara ang page anytime."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "To come back, open <a href=\"%(link_hub)s\">My Applications</a> and enter your email, or open the <strong>verification email</strong> we sent you and tap <strong>&ldquo;Continue your application&rdquo;</strong>. We&rsquo;ll send a fresh code to confirm it&rsquo;s you, then everything you added is waiting. Remember to submit before the application deadline."
msgstr "Para bumalik, buksan ang <a href=\"%(link_hub)s\">My Applications</a> at ilagay ang email mo, o buksan ang <strong>verification email</strong> na pinadala namin at i-tap ang <strong>&ldquo;Ituloy ang application mo&rdquo;</strong>. Magpapadala kami ng bagong code para ma-confirm na ikaw iyan, tapos nandoon pa rin lahat ng nailagay mo. Huwag kalimutang mag-submit bago ang deadline."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "What documents do I need to prepare?"
msgstr "Anong documents ang kailangan kong ihanda?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "The required documents are listed on each position&rsquo;s detail page before you start applying. Requirements differ between Plantilla and COS entries, but common documents include:"
msgstr "Nakalista ang required documents sa details page ng bawat position bago ka magsimula mag-apply. Magkaiba ang requirements ng Plantilla at COS, pero kadalasang kasama ang:"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Signed application or cover letter for the selected position"
msgstr "Pirmadong application o cover letter para sa position"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Personal Data Sheet (CS Form No. 212, Revised 2026) with Work Experience Sheet"
msgstr "Personal Data Sheet (CS Form No. 212, Revised 2026) kasama ang Work Experience Sheet"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Eligibility, rating, or license documents where required by the posting"
msgstr "Eligibility, rating, o license kung hinihingi ng posting"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Diploma and transcript of records"
msgstr "Diploma at transcript of records"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Employment and training certificates where applicable to the selected branch"
msgstr "Employment at training certificates kung kailangan"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Documents should be saved as <strong>PDF, JPG, or PNG</strong> files, with a maximum size of 5 MB per file."
msgstr "Dapat <strong>PDF, JPG, o PNG</strong> ang documents, hanggang 5 MB bawat file."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Where do I get the blank PDS and Work Experience Sheet?"
msgstr "Saan ko makukuha ang blank na PDS at Work Experience Sheet?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "You can download the official Civil Service Commission forms here &mdash; no need to search online. Fill them up on a computer, then save or scan the finished forms as PDF before uploading."
msgstr "Puwede mong i-download dito ang official forms ng Civil Service Commission &mdash; hindi na kailangang maghanap online. Sagutan ang mga ito sa computer, tapos i-save o i-scan bilang PDF bago i-upload."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "New to the PDS? Read our <a href=\"%(link1)s\">plain-language guide to filling up your PDS</a>."
msgstr "Bago sa PDS? Basahin ang <a href=\"%(link1)s\">simpleng gabay sa pag-fill up ng PDS</a>."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Can I apply for more than one position?"
msgstr "Puwede ba akong mag-apply sa higit sa isang position?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Yes. You may apply for multiple open positions. Each position requires a separate application submission, with its own Tracking Code and case number. To see all of them in one place, open <a href=\"%(url)s\">My Applications</a> and enter your email."
msgstr "Oo. Puwede kang mag-apply sa maraming bakanteng position. Hiwalay na application ang bawat position, may sariling Tracking Code at case number. Para makita lahat sa iisang lugar, buksan ang <a href=\"%(url)s\">My Applications</a> at ilagay ang email mo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "What&rsquo;s the difference between Plantilla and Contract of Service?"
msgstr "Ano ang pinagkaiba ng Plantilla at Contract of Service?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "What if I don&rsquo;t have a personal email address?"
msgstr "Paano kung wala akong personal na email?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "You will need a working email address you can check, because we send the verification code and all status updates there."
msgstr "Kailangan mo ng email na nache-check mo, dahil doon namin ipinapadala ang verification code at lahat ng status updates."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "If you don&rsquo;t have one yet, free email accounts from Gmail, Yahoo, or Outlook take a few minutes to create on a phone or computer. If you really cannot create one, you may use a trusted family member&rsquo;s email &mdash; just remember to use the same address every time you check your status."
msgstr "Kung wala ka pa, ilang minuto lang ang paggawa ng libreng email sa Gmail, Yahoo, o Outlook gamit ang phone o computer. Kung talagang hindi ka makagawa, puwede mong gamitin ang email ng pinagkakatiwalaan mong kapamilya &mdash; basta parehong email ang gamitin mo tuwing magche-check ka ng status."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "For help, contact the HRMU (details below)."
msgstr "Para sa tulong, i-contact ang HRMU (details sa baba)."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "My file is too large to upload. What do I do?"
msgstr "Masyadong malaki ang file ko. Ano ang gagawin ko?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Each file must be 5 MB or smaller. Most people won&rsquo;t hit this:"
msgstr "Hanggang 5 MB lang ang bawat file. Kadalasan, hindi mo ito aabutin:"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "<strong>Photos:</strong> large phone photos are shrunk automatically before they upload."
msgstr "<strong>Pictures:</strong> automatic na pinapaliit ang malalaking picture galing sa phone bago ma-upload."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "<strong>Several pages:</strong> you don&rsquo;t need one big file &mdash; add the pages one by one (or as several photos) and we combine them for you."
msgstr "<strong>Maraming pages:</strong> hindi mo kailangan ng isang malaking file &mdash; i-upload ang pages isa-isa (o ilang pictures) at kami na ang magsasama."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "<strong>Scanned PDFs:</strong> if one PDF is still too large, scan at a lower resolution (200&ndash;300 DPI is enough), or split it and add the parts separately."
msgstr "<strong>Scanned PDFs:</strong> kung malaki pa rin ang isang PDF, i-scan sa mas mababang resolution (sapat na ang 200&ndash;300 DPI), o hatiin ito at i-upload nang hiwalay."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "<strong>Multi-page PDFs:</strong> some scanners produce huge files because each page is saved as an image. Use a PDF compressor (iLovePDF, Smallpdf) to reduce the file size."
msgstr "<strong>Multi-page PDFs:</strong> may mga scanner na gumagawa ng napakalaking file dahil image ang bawat page. Gumamit ng PDF compressor (iLovePDF, Smallpdf) para lumiit ang file."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "<strong>Long documents:</strong> if a single document genuinely needs to be larger, email the HRMU and we&rsquo;ll guide you through an alternate submission."
msgstr "<strong>Mahahabang documents:</strong> kung talagang kailangang mas malaki ang isang document, i-email ang HRMU at tutulungan ka namin sa ibang paraan ng pagpasa."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Can I edit or withdraw my application after submitting?"
msgstr "Puwede ko bang i-edit o i-withdraw ang application ko pagka-submit?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Once you click <strong>&ldquo;Submit my application&rdquo;</strong>, your application can no longer be edited online. To withdraw, open your status page and use <strong>&ldquo;Withdraw my application&rdquo;</strong>; the office will record it and email you. For a correction, contact the HRMU (below) with your case number."
msgstr "Kapag na-click mo na ang <strong>&ldquo;I-submit ang application ko&rdquo;</strong>, hindi na mae-edit online ang application mo. Para mag-withdraw, buksan ang status page mo at gamitin ang <strong>&ldquo;I-withdraw ang application ko&rdquo;</strong>; ire-record ito ng office at i-e-email ka. Para sa correction, i-contact ang HRMU (sa baba) kasama ang case number mo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Email verification"
msgstr "Email verification"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "I didn&rsquo;t receive the verification code. What should I do?"
msgstr "Hindi ko natanggap ang verification code. Ano ang gagawin ko?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Check your <strong>Spam</strong> or <strong>Junk Mail</strong> folder. The email comes from a government recruitment address and may be filtered."
msgstr "I-check ang <strong>Spam</strong> o <strong>Junk Mail</strong> folder mo. Galing ang email sa government recruitment address at baka na-filter."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Make sure the email address you entered is correct &mdash; go back and check."
msgstr "Siguraduhing tama ang email na nailagay mo &mdash; bumalik at i-check."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Tap <strong>&ldquo;Resend the code&rdquo;</strong> on the verification page to request a new code. You can resend once every 60 seconds."
msgstr "I-tap ang <strong>&ldquo;I-resend ang code&rdquo;</strong> sa verification page para humingi ng bagong code. Puwede kang mag-resend kada 60 segundo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "If you still don&rsquo;t receive it after a few minutes, try a different email address and start a new application."
msgstr "Kung hindi mo pa rin natatanggap pagkalipas ng ilang minuto, gumamit ng ibang email at magsimula ng bagong application."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "How long is the verification code valid?"
msgstr "Gaano katagal valid ang verification code?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Each 6-digit code works for %(minutes)s minute after it is sent. If it expires, tap <strong>&ldquo;Resend the code&rdquo;</strong> to get a fresh one."
msgid_plural "Each 6-digit code works for %(minutes)s minutes after it is sent. If it expires, tap <strong>&ldquo;Resend the code&rdquo;</strong> to get a fresh one."
msgstr[0] "Valid ang bawat 6-digit code nang %(minutes)s minuto pagkapadala. Kapag nag-expire, i-tap ang <strong>&ldquo;I-resend ang code&rdquo;</strong> para makakuha ng bago."
msgstr[1] "Valid ang bawat 6-digit code nang %(minutes)s minuto pagkapadala. Kapag nag-expire, i-tap ang <strong>&ldquo;I-resend ang code&rdquo;</strong> para makakuha ng bago."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "I entered the wrong email address. Can I correct it?"
msgstr "Mali ang email na nailagay ko. Puwede ko bang ayusin?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Yes. On the verification page, tap <strong>&ldquo;Start again with the correct email&rdquo;</strong> and enter the right address. The code goes to the new address. Nothing was uploaded yet at that point, so you don&rsquo;t lose any documents."
msgstr "Oo. Sa verification page, i-tap ang <strong>&ldquo;Ulitin gamit ang tamang email&rdquo;</strong> at ilagay ang tamang email. Sa bagong email na mapupunta ang code. Wala ka pang na-upload sa puntong iyon, kaya walang mawawalang documents."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "After submitting"
msgstr "Pagka-submit"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "What are the Tracking Code and Case Reference?"
msgstr "Ano ang Tracking Code at Case Reference?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "When you submit, you receive two references with different jobs. Your <strong>Tracking Code</strong> (looks like <strong>TRK-7KQ4-M9X2</strong>) is private &mdash; together with your email it lets you <a href=\"%(link2)s\">track your application</a> online. Treat it like a password. Your <strong>case number</strong> (looks like <strong>Case No. 2026-0147</strong>) is the reference you quote when you call or email the office. Both are shown on your confirmation page and sent to your email."
msgstr "Pagka-submit mo, makakatanggap ka ng dalawang reference na magkaiba ang gamit. Pribado ang <strong>Tracking Code</strong> mo (parang <strong>TRK-7KQ4-M9X2</strong>) &mdash; kasama ng email mo, ito ang gamit para <a href=\"%(link2)s\">i-track ang application mo</a> online. Parang password ito. Ang <strong>case number</strong> mo (parang <strong>Case No. 2026-0147</strong>) ang sasabihin mo kapag tumawag o nag-email ka sa office. Parehong nakalagay ang dalawa sa confirmation page mo at in-email din sa iyo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "I lost my Tracking Code. Can you help?"
msgstr "Nawala ko ang Tracking Code ko. Matutulungan ba ninyo ako?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "You don&rsquo;t need it. Open <a href=\"%(link_hub)s\">My Applications</a> and enter the email you applied with. We send you a 6-digit code, then you see every application you made, with its status and receipt."
msgstr "Hindi mo na ito kailangan. Buksan ang <a href=\"%(link_hub)s\">My Applications</a> at ilagay ang email na ginamit mo sa pag-apply. Magpapadala kami ng 6-digit code, tapos makikita mo lahat ng application mo, kasama ang status at resibo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Your Tracking Code is also in the confirmation email we sent when you submitted. Its subject line includes &ldquo;DOH–CHD CALABARZON Recruitment Portal&rdquo;."
msgstr "Nasa confirmation email din ang Tracking Code mo na pinadala namin noong nag-submit ka. May &ldquo;DOH–CHD CALABARZON Recruitment Portal&rdquo; sa subject nito."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "How do I check my application status?"
msgstr "Paano ko iche-check ang status ng application ko?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Open <a href=\"%(link3)s\">My Applications</a> and enter your email. We send you a 6-digit code, then you see every application you made with that email and its status, in plain language. Prefer your tracking code? Use the <a href=\"%(link3b)s\">tracking code page</a> instead."
msgstr "Buksan ang <a href=\"%(link3)s\">My Applications</a> at ilagay ang email mo. Magpapadala kami ng 6-digit code, tapos makikita mo lahat ng application na ginawa mo gamit ang email na iyon at ang status ng bawat isa. Mas gusto mo ang tracking code? Gamitin ang <a href=\"%(link3b)s\">tracking code page</a>."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Easier: every status update email we send includes a direct link straight to your status page &mdash; just click that."
msgstr "Mas madali: may direct link sa status page mo ang bawat status update email na pinapadala namin &mdash; i-click mo lang iyon."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Can I follow up by phone?"
msgstr "Puwede ba akong mag-follow up sa phone?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Yes. Call the Human Resource Management Unit (HRMU) at <a href=\"tel:%(tel)s\"><strong>%(phone)s</strong></a>. Have your case number ready so we can look up your case right away &mdash; never share your Tracking Code over the phone; it&rsquo;s not needed for assistance."
msgstr "Oo. Tumawag sa Human Resource Management Unit (HRMU) sa <a href=\"tel:%(tel)s\"><strong>%(phone)s</strong></a>. Ihanda ang case number mo para mahanap agad namin ang case mo &mdash; huwag ibigay ang Tracking Code mo sa phone; hindi ito kailangan."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Can someone else check my application status for me?"
msgstr "Puwede bang ibang tao ang mag-check ng status ko?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Yes &mdash; but only someone you trust. A family member with your Tracking Code and the email address you used can check your status on the <a href=\"%(link4)s\">tracking code page</a>. This is useful if you&rsquo;re overseas (OFW) or working in an area without good internet. Share the code only with someone checking on your behalf."
msgstr "Oo &mdash; pero sa taong pinagkakatiwalaan mo lang. Puwedeng i-check ng kapamilya mo ang status mo sa <a href=\"%(link4)s\">tracking code page</a> gamit ang Tracking Code mo at ang email na ginamit mo. Makakatulong ito kung nasa abroad ka (OFW) o nasa lugar na mahina ang internet. Ibigay lang ang code sa taong magche-check para sa iyo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "The status page does not show personal information beyond your name and the position. We don&rsquo;t send full application data over phone or email to people other than you."
msgstr "Walang personal info sa status page maliban sa pangalan mo at position. Hindi kami nagbibigay ng buong application data sa phone o email sa ibang tao maliban sa iyo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Can I view the documents I submitted?"
msgstr "Puwede ko bang makita ang documents na in-submit ko?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "You can see the list. Your receipt names every file we received &mdash; open <a href=\"%(link_hub)s\">My Applications</a> and tap <strong>Receipt (PDF)</strong>. For your privacy, the files themselves are not shown again online. If something looks wrong, contact the HRMU with your case number."
msgstr "Makikita mo ang listahan. Nakalista sa resibo mo ang bawat file na natanggap namin &mdash; buksan ang <a href=\"%(link_hub)s\">My Applications</a> at i-tap ang <strong>Resibo (PDF)</strong>. Para sa privacy mo, hindi na ipinapakita ulit online ang mismong mga file. Kung may mali, i-contact ang HRMU at ibigay ang case number mo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "What does &ldquo;Action Required&rdquo; mean?"
msgstr "Ano ang ibig sabihin ng &ldquo;May Kailangan Kang Gawin&rdquo;?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "It means something in your application needs your action &mdash; usually a document that has to be corrected. Open your status page (from My Applications or the link in our email) and follow &ldquo;What you need to do&rdquo;. If documents were returned, tap <strong>Resubmit documents</strong> there. Questions? Contact the HRMU (below) with your case number."
msgstr "Ibig sabihin, may kailangan kang gawin sa application mo &mdash; kadalasan, document na kailangang ayusin. Buksan ang status page mo (mula sa My Applications o sa link sa email namin) at sundin ang &ldquo;Ang kailangan mong gawin&rdquo;. Kung may ibinalik na documents, i-tap doon ang <strong>I-resubmit ang documents</strong>. May tanong? I-contact ang HRMU (sa baba) at ibigay ang case number mo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "How long does the recruitment process take?"
msgstr "Gaano katagal ang recruitment process?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "We will email you when there is news on your application &mdash; you don&rsquo;t need to follow up unless your status shows &ldquo;Action Required.&rdquo; The timeline depends on the position, the number of applicants, and Civil Service Commission processes."
msgstr "I-e-email ka namin kapag may update sa application mo &mdash; hindi mo kailangang mag-follow up maliban kung &ldquo;May Kailangan Kang Gawin&rdquo; ang status mo. Depende ang tagal sa position, dami ng applicants, at proseso ng Civil Service Commission."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Contact the Human Resource Management Unit"
msgstr "I-contact ang Human Resource Management Unit"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "Still have questions? We&rsquo;re here to help."
msgstr "May tanong pa? Nandito kami para tumulong."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "<span class=\"rg-help-pad__channel-label\">Call the Human Resource Management Unit (HRMU)</span> <a href=\"tel:%(tel)s\" class=\"rg-help-pad__channel-value\">%(phone)s</a>"
msgstr "<span class=\"rg-help-pad__channel-label\">Tumawag sa Human Resource Management Unit (HRMU)</span> <a href=\"tel:%(tel)s\" class=\"rg-help-pad__channel-value\">%(phone)s</a>"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
msgid "<span class=\"rg-help-pad__channel-label\">Email the HRMU</span> <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\" class=\"rg-help-pad__channel-value\">%(email)s</a>"
msgstr "<span class=\"rg-help-pad__channel-label\">Mag-email sa HRMU</span> <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\" class=\"rg-help-pad__channel-value\">%(email)s</a>"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_help.html
