msgstr "6 na numbers ang code — hindi puwede ang letters o ibang characters."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_otp.html
msgid "(available in {seconds}s)"
msgstr "(puwede na ulit sa loob ng {seconds}s)"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "How to Fill Up Your PDS"
msgstr "Paano Mag-fill Up ng PDS"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_vacancy_detail.html
msgid "Breadcrumb"
msgstr "Breadcrumb"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "<a href=\"%(link6)s\">Home</a> <span class=\"rg-pub-breadcrumb__sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span> <a href=\"%(link7)s\">Help</a> <span class=\"rg-pub-breadcrumb__sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span> <span>How to fill up your PDS</span>"
msgstr "<a href=\"%(link6)s\">Home</a> <span class=\"rg-pub-breadcrumb__sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span> <a href=\"%(link7)s\">Tulong</a> <span class=\"rg-pub-breadcrumb__sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span> <span>Paano mag-fill up ng PDS</span>"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "How to fill up your Personal Data Sheet (PDS)"
msgstr "Paano mag-fill up ng Personal Data Sheet (PDS)"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "The Personal Data Sheet (CS Form No. 212) is the standard government form that tells us who you are, where you studied, and what work you have done. Every applicant submits one. This page explains it in plain language and points out the mistakes we see most often. It follows the Civil Service Commission&rsquo;s official guide &mdash; if anything here is ever unclear, the CSC guide is the final word."
msgstr "Ang Personal Data Sheet (CS Form No. 212) ay ang standard na government form na nagsasabi kung sino ka, saan ka nag-aral, at anong trabaho na ang nagawa mo. Bawat applicant ay nagpapasa nito. Ipinapaliwanag ng page na ito ang PDS sa simpleng salita at itinuturo ang mga madalas na pagkakamali. Sinusunod nito ang official guide ng Civil Service Commission &mdash; kung may hindi malinaw, ang CSC guide ang masusunod."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Download first"
msgstr "I-download muna"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "Bago ka magsimula"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "You will need:"
msgstr "Kakailanganin mo ang:"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "<strong>A computer with Microsoft Excel.</strong> The PDS must be typed, not handwritten. Free programs such as LibreOffice can open the file, but they may break its tick boxes and page layout &mdash; check every page carefully if you use one. Filling it up on a phone is not practical; use a computer, or ask a computer shop for help."
msgstr "<strong>Computer na may Microsoft Excel.</strong> Dapat naka-type ang PDS, hindi sulat-kamay. Kayang buksan ng libreng programs gaya ng LibreOffice ang file, pero baka masira ang tick boxes at layout &mdash; i-check nang mabuti ang bawat page kung ito ang gamit mo. Hindi praktikal ang pag-fill up sa phone; gumamit ng computer, o magpatulong sa computer shop."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Your school records, eligibility or license details, and job history &mdash; including exact dates."
msgstr "Ang school records mo, details ng eligibility o license, at job history &mdash; kasama ang eksaktong dates."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "A recent passport-size photo (4.5&nbsp;cm &times; 3.5&nbsp;cm), taken within the last six months, with no filters. A digital photo is fine."
msgstr "Bagong passport-size na picture (4.5&nbsp;cm &times; 3.5&nbsp;cm), kuha sa loob ng huling anim na buwan, walang filter. Puwede ang digital na picture."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Any valid government ID."
msgstr "Kahit anong valid government ID."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Take your time. It is normal for this to take an hour or two the first time. Save your file as you go."
msgstr "Huwag magmadali. Normal na isa o dalawang oras ito sa unang beses. I-save ang file habang ginagawa mo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "The five rules that cause the most corrections"
msgstr "Ang limang rules na pinakamadalas ipaayos"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "<strong>Write your name in this order: SURNAME, FIRST NAME, NAME EXTENSION, MIDDLE NAME.</strong> Name extension means Jr., Sr., III &mdash; leave it blank if you have none. Use the same order for your spouse and your parents."
msgstr "<strong>Isulat ang pangalan mo sa ganitong order: SURNAME, FIRST NAME, NAME EXTENSION, MIDDLE NAME.</strong> Ang name extension ay Jr., Sr., III &mdash; iwanang blangko kung wala. Ganito rin ang order para sa asawa at mga magulang mo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "<strong>Dates are day/month/year (dd/mm/yyyy).</strong> 5 March 2001 is <code>05/03/2001</code>, not <code>03/05/2001</code>."
msgstr "<strong>Day/month/year ang dates (dd/mm/yyyy).</strong> Ang 5 March 2001 ay <code>05/03/2001</code>, hindi <code>03/05/2001</code>."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "<strong>Never leave a box empty. Write <code>N/A</code> if it does not apply to you.</strong> A blank box looks like a forgotten answer; <code>N/A</code> shows you read the question."
msgstr "<strong>Huwag mag-iwan ng blangkong box. Isulat ang <code>N/A</code> kung hindi ito para sa iyo.</strong> Mukhang nakalimutang sagot ang blangkong box; ipinapakita ng <code>N/A</code> na nabasa mo ang tanong."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "<strong>Do not abbreviate.</strong> Write the complete name of every school, office, and organization &mdash; <em>Civil Service Commission</em>, not <em>CSC</em>; <em>BS Psychology</em>, not <em>BSP</em>."
msgstr "<strong>Huwag mag-abbreviate.</strong> Isulat nang buo ang pangalan ng bawat school, office, at organization &mdash; <em>Civil Service Commission</em>, hindi <em>CSC</em>; <em>BS Psychology</em>, hindi <em>BSP</em>."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "<strong>Answer everything truthfully.</strong> The form carries a legal warning: a false statement in the PDS can be grounds for an administrative or criminal case."
msgstr "<strong>Sagutin lahat nang totoo.</strong> May legal na babala ang form: puwedeng maging dahilan ng administrative o criminal case ang maling pahayag sa PDS."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Section by section"
msgstr "Bawat section"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "I. Personal information"
msgstr "I. Personal information"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Your full name, birth date and birthplace, sex, civil status, height, weight, citizenship, addresses, and contact details. If your civil status is &ldquo;Others&rdquo;, say what it is. If you hold dual or foreign citizenship, pick the country from the list in the form. &ldquo;Agency employee number&rdquo; means your employee ID in the office where you work now &mdash; write <code>N/A</code> if you are not a government employee."
msgstr "Ang buong pangalan mo, birth date at birthplace, sex, civil status, height, weight, citizenship, address, at contact details. Kung &ldquo;Others&rdquo; ang civil status mo, isulat kung ano ito. Kung dual o foreign ang citizenship mo, piliin ang bansa sa listahan sa form. Ang &ldquo;Agency employee number&rdquo; ay ang employee ID mo sa office kung saan ka nagtatrabaho ngayon &mdash; isulat ang <code>N/A</code> kung hindi ka government employee."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "II. Family background"
msgstr "II. Family background"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Your spouse, your parents, and <strong>all</strong> your children with their birth dates. Two things people miss:"
msgstr "Ang asawa mo, mga magulang mo, at <strong>lahat</strong> ng anak mo kasama ang birth dates nila. Dalawang bagay na madalas makalimutan:"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Your mother&rsquo;s name here is her <strong>maiden name</strong> &mdash; her name before she married (<em>pangalan bago ikasal</em>)."
msgstr "Ang pangalan ng nanay mo rito ay ang <strong>maiden name</strong> niya &mdash; pangalan niya bago ikasal (<em>pangalan bago ikasal</em>)."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "List every child, even those who are adults or no longer living with you."
msgstr "Ilista lahat ng anak, kahit nasa hustong gulang na o hindi na nakatira sa iyo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "III. Educational background"
msgstr "III. Educational background"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "For each level &mdash; elementary, secondary, vocational, college, graduate studies:"
msgstr "Para sa bawat level &mdash; elementary, secondary, vocational, college, graduate studies:"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "The <strong>full</strong> name of the school."
msgstr "Ang <strong>buong</strong> pangalan ng school."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "The course, written in full."
msgstr "Ang course, nakasulat nang buo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "The school years you attended, like <code>2015-2019</code>."
msgstr "Ang school years na pumasok ka, gaya ng <code>2015-2019</code>."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "If you finished, the year you graduated. <strong>If you did not finish, write the highest grade, level, or number of units you earned</strong> &mdash; that is a valid answer, not a blank."
msgstr "Kung natapos mo, ang taon ng graduation. <strong>Kung hindi mo natapos, isulat ang pinakamataas na grade, level, o units na nakuha mo</strong> &mdash; valid na sagot iyon, hindi blangko."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Any scholarship or academic honor you received."
msgstr "Kahit anong scholarship o academic honor na natanggap mo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "For elementary, write <em>PRIMARY EDUCATION</em> if you graduated. For high school, write <em>HIGH SCHOOL</em> if you finished under the old curriculum, or <em>JUNIOR HIGH SCHOOL</em> / <em>SENIOR HIGH SCHOOL</em> under K-12."
msgstr "Para sa elementary, isulat ang <em>PRIMARY EDUCATION</em> kung nag-graduate ka. Para sa high school, isulat ang <em>HIGH SCHOOL</em> kung old curriculum, o <em>JUNIOR HIGH SCHOOL</em> / <em>SENIOR HIGH SCHOOL</em> kung K-12."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "IV. Civil service eligibility"
msgstr "IV. Civil service eligibility"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Every eligibility you hold, with your rating, and the date and place of the examination or conferment. This includes eligibilities granted by law, not only exams &mdash; honor graduate, barangay official, veteran preference, and similar. If your eligibility is a professional license (RA 1080), add the license number and its expiry date."
msgstr "Lahat ng eligibility mo, kasama ang rating, at ang date at lugar ng exam o pagkakaloob. Kasama rito ang mga eligibility na galing sa batas, hindi lang exam &mdash; honor graduate, barangay official, veteran preference, at iba pa. Kung professional license (RA 1080) ang eligibility mo, idagdag ang license number at expiry date."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Write <code>N/A</code> if you have none. Not having an eligibility does not disqualify you from every position."
msgstr "Isulat ang <code>N/A</code> kung wala ka. Hindi ka diskwalipikado sa lahat ng position kahit wala kang eligibility."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "V. Work experience"
msgstr "V. Work experience"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "All your jobs &mdash; government and private &mdash; <strong>starting with your current or most recent one</strong>. For each: exact start and end dates, the complete position title, the complete name of the office or company, your monthly salary in figures (for example <code>P21,877.00</code>), salary grade and step increment if you had one (written like <code>24-2</code>), your employment status (permanent, temporary, casual, contractual), and whether it was government service (yes or no)."
msgstr "Lahat ng trabaho mo &mdash; government at private &mdash; <strong>simula sa current o pinakahuli</strong>. Para sa bawat isa: eksaktong start at end dates, buong position title, buong pangalan ng office o company, buwanang sahod sa numero (halimbawa <code>P21,877.00</code>), salary grade at step increment kung meron (isinusulat na <code>24-2</code>), employment status (permanent, temporary, casual, contractual), at kung government service ba ito (yes o no)."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "<strong>Important for job applicants:</strong> the CSC also asks for a separate <strong>Work Experience Sheet (WES)</strong> when you apply for a vacant position. It lists only the experience relevant to the job you are applying for, and it is submitted together with your PDS. You can download the blank WES at the top of this page."
msgstr "<strong>Mahalaga para sa applicants:</strong> humihingi rin ang CSC ng hiwalay na <strong>Work Experience Sheet (WES)</strong> kapag nag-a-apply ka sa bakanteng position. Nakalista rito ang experience na related lang sa trabahong ina-apply-an mo, at ipinapasa ito kasama ng PDS mo. Puwede mong i-download ang blank na WES sa itaas ng page na ito."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "VI. Voluntary work"
msgstr "VI. Voluntary work"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Any volunteer work with an organization &mdash; the organization&rsquo;s complete name and address, your dates, the number of hours, and what you did there. Barangay, church, school, and community volunteer work all count. Write <code>N/A</code> if you have none."
msgstr "Kahit anong volunteer work sa isang organization &mdash; buong pangalan at address ng organization, dates mo, bilang ng oras, at ginawa mo roon. Kasama ang volunteer work sa barangay, simbahan, school, at komunidad. Isulat ang <code>N/A</code> kung wala ka."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "VII. Learning and development (trainings and seminars)"
msgstr "VII. Learning and development (trainings at seminars)"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Trainings, seminars, and workshops you attended, <strong>most recent first</strong>: the full title of the program, the dates, the number of hours, the type (managerial, supervisory, technical), and the complete name of the office or institution that ran it."
msgstr "Mga training, seminar, at workshop na dinaluhan mo, <strong>simula sa pinakabago</strong>: buong title ng program, dates, bilang ng oras, klase (managerial, supervisory, technical), at buong pangalan ng office o institution na nag-organize."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "VIII. Other information"
msgstr "VIII. Other information"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Your special skills and hobbies; any non-academic awards, recognitions or distinctions, written out in full; and any professional association you belong to, also written in full."
msgstr "Ang special skills at hobbies mo; mga non-academic award, recognition o distinction, nakasulat nang buo; at mga professional association na kasapi ka, nakasulat din nang buo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Questions 34 to 40"
msgstr "Questions 34 hanggang 40"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "These are the sworn questions &mdash; about relationships to people in the agency, administrative or criminal cases, convictions, separation from service, election candidacy, and indigenous or PWD status. Answer every one, and <strong>whenever you answer &ldquo;Yes&rdquo;, give the details</strong> in the space provided."
msgstr "Ito ang mga sinumpaang tanong &mdash; tungkol sa kamag-anak sa agency, administrative o criminal cases, conviction, pagkatanggal sa serbisyo, pagtakbo sa eleksyon, at indigenous o PWD status. Sagutin lahat, at <strong>tuwing &ldquo;Yes&rdquo; ang sagot mo, ibigay ang details</strong> sa space na nakalaan."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Question 41 &mdash; references"
msgstr "Question 41 &mdash; references"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Three people who can vouch for you, and who are <strong>not related to you</strong>. Give each one&rsquo;s complete name, their office or home address, and a contact number or email. Tell them you listed them."
msgstr "Tatlong taong makakapagpatunay tungkol sa iyo, at <strong>hindi mo kamag-anak</strong>. Ibigay ang buong pangalan, office o home address, at contact number o email ng bawat isa. Sabihan sila na inilista mo sila."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Question 42 &mdash; the last step"
msgstr "Question 42 &mdash; ang huling step"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Sign the form &mdash; an e-signature is accepted. If you are unable to sign, use your right thumbmark instead."
msgstr "Pirmahan ang form &mdash; tinatanggap ang e-signature. Kung hindi ka makapirma, gamitin ang right thumbmark mo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Write your government ID number and the date it was issued."
msgstr "Isulat ang government ID number mo at kung kailan ito na-issue."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Attach your passport-size photo (a digital photo is fine)."
msgstr "Ilagay ang passport-size picture mo (puwede ang digital)."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Put your signature and the date on the bottom of every page."
msgstr "Pirmahan at lagyan ng date ang ibaba ng bawat page."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Finishing and uploading your PDS"
msgstr "Pagtatapos at pag-upload ng PDS mo"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "This portal accepts <strong>PDF, JPG, and PNG</strong> files only &mdash; not Excel files. Choose one way:"
msgstr "<strong>PDF, JPG, at PNG</strong> files lang ang tinatanggap ng portal na ito &mdash; hindi Excel. Pumili ng isang paraan:"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Option A &mdash; all on the computer"
msgstr "Option A &mdash; lahat sa computer"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Add your e-signature (or digital certificate) and the date at the bottom of every page."
msgstr "Ilagay ang e-signature mo (o digital certificate) at date sa ibaba ng bawat page."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Add your digital passport-size photo in the photo box."
msgstr "Ilagay ang digital passport-size picture mo sa photo box."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Save the finished file as PDF: in Excel, <em>File &rarr; Save as</em> (or <em>Export</em>) and choose PDF."
msgstr "I-save ang tapos na file bilang PDF: sa Excel, <em>File &rarr; Save as</em> (o <em>Export</em>) at piliin ang PDF."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Option B &mdash; print and sign"
msgstr "Option B &mdash; i-print at pirmahan"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Print the filled-up form."
msgstr "I-print ang na-fill up na form."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Sign it and write the date at the bottom of every page, and attach your photo."
msgstr "Pirmahan at lagyan ng date ang ibaba ng bawat page, at idikit ang picture mo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Scan it, or take a clear, straight photo of every page."
msgstr "I-scan ito, o picturan nang malinaw at diretso ang bawat page."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Either way:"
msgstr "Alinman sa dalawa:"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "<strong>Include only the extra sheets you actually used.</strong> The workbook has continuation sheets (C5 to C11) for people who need more rows. If you did not use one, leave it out."
msgstr "<strong>Isama lang ang extra sheets na ginamit mo.</strong> May continuation sheets ang workbook (C5 hanggang C11) para sa nangangailangan ng dagdag na rows. Kung hindi mo ginamit, huwag nang isama."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Check that your name, dates, and school names read exactly as they do on your other documents. Mismatches are the most common reason we return an application for correction."
msgstr "I-check na eksaktong pareho ang pangalan, dates, at pangalan ng school sa ibang documents mo. Ito ang pinakamadalas na dahilan kung bakit namin ibinabalik ang application para ayusin."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Upload it on the application form under <strong>Personal Data Sheet</strong>, and the Work Experience Sheet under <strong>Work Experience Sheet</strong>."
msgstr "I-upload ito sa application form sa ilalim ng <strong>Personal Data Sheet</strong>, at ang Work Experience Sheet sa ilalim ng <strong>Work Experience Sheet</strong>."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "If a document is returned for correction, you will get an email that says what to fix and by when. You can re-upload from the same link &mdash; you do not start over."
msgstr "Kapag may ibinalik na document para ayusin, makakatanggap ka ng email na nagsasabi kung ano ang aayusin at hanggang kailan. Puwede kang mag-upload ulit gamit ang parehong link &mdash; hindi ka magsisimula ulit."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Still need help"
msgstr "Kailangan pa ng tulong"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "Still stuck?"
msgstr "May tanong pa?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "The Human Resource Management Unit (HRMU) can help: <a href=\"tel:%(tel)s\">%(phone)s</a> &middot; <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>. Have your case number ready if you already applied."
msgstr "Matutulungan ka ng Human Resource Management Unit (HRMU): <a href=\"tel:%(tel)s\">%(phone)s</a> &middot; <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>. Ihanda ang case number mo kung nakapag-apply ka na."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_pds_guide.html
msgid "<a href=\"%(link8)s\" class=\"rg-pub-back\">&larr; Back to Help</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"%(link8)s\" class=\"rg-pub-back\">&larr; Bumalik sa Tulong</a>"

