#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/includes/branch_explainer.html
msgid "<strong>Plantilla (Permanent)</strong> positions are regular government posts with full Civil Service tenure and full government benefits. They follow the standard Civil Service Commission appointment process and are funded by a regular plantilla item."
msgstr "Ang <strong>Plantilla (Permanent)</strong> positions ay regular na trabaho sa gobyerno na may Civil Service tenure at kumpletong government benefits. Dumadaan ito sa normal na appointment process ng Civil Service Commission at may regular na plantilla item."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/includes/branch_explainer.html
msgid "<strong>Contract of Service (COS)</strong> positions are time-bound engagements for specific work or projects. They do not carry tenure or Civil Service eligibility, and the benefits package differs from a permanent appointment."
msgstr "Ang <strong>Contract of Service (COS)</strong> positions ay trabahong may takdang panahon para sa specific na trabaho o project. Wala itong tenure o Civil Service eligibility, at iba ang benefits kumpara sa permanent na appointment."

