msgstr "Mukhang lumang PDS ito (Revised 2017). Ang kailangan ng office ay ang Revised 2026 form, kaya baka ibalik ito sa iyo. I-download ang 2026 form sa card na ito, sagutan, at i-upload ito."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Application submitted"
msgstr "Na-submit ang application"

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Some documents were returned to you to fix."
msgstr "May ilang documents na ibinalik sa iyo para ayusin."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "The recruitment team is checking your documents and qualifications."
msgstr "Chine-check ng recruitment team ang documents at qualifications mo."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Examination"
msgstr "Exam"

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Interview"
msgstr "Interview"

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Appointment"
msgstr "appointment"

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Contract"
msgstr "contract"

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "This verification link is no longer available. Please start again from the job openings page."
msgstr "Hindi na gumagana ang verification link na ito. Magsimula ulit sa job openings page."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "This applicant action is not available."
msgstr "Hindi puwede ang action na ito."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Application submitted successfully."
msgstr "Na-submit na ang application mo."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "This link is no longer available. Open My Applications and enter your email."
msgstr "Hindi na available ang link na ito. Buksan ang My Applications at ilagay ang email mo."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "This action is not available."
msgstr "Hindi puwede ang action na ito."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Document check"
msgstr "Document check"

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Examination and interview"
msgstr "Exam at interview"

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "If you are invited to an exam or interview, we will email you the schedule."
msgstr "Kung ma-invite ka sa exam o interview, i-e-email namin sa iyo ang schedule."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Decision: Approved"
msgstr "Desisyon: Approved"

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "This position is no longer accepting applications. You can browse the other open positions below."
msgstr "Hindi na tumatanggap ng applicants ang position na ito. Puwede mong tingnan ang ibang job openings sa baba."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "This application link is no longer available."
msgstr "Hindi na gumagana ang link ng application na ito."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Verify your email to continue your application."
msgstr "I-verify ang email mo para ituloy ang application mo."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Your answers were saved. Files are saved as soon as you add them."
msgstr "Na-save ang mga sagot mo. Nase-save agad ang files pagka-upload."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "This receipt link is no longer available. If you already submitted, open My Applications and enter your email."
msgstr "Hindi na available ang link ng resibo na ito. Kung nag-submit ka na, buksan ang My Applications at ilagay ang email mo."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Your verification session has ended. Enter your Tracking Code and email again."
msgstr "Na-end na ang verification session mo. Ilagay ulit ang Tracking Code at email mo."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "A new verification code has been sent to your email address."
msgstr "Nagpadala kami ng bagong verification code sa email mo."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "We could not find an application with that tracking code and email combination. Please check your Tracking Code and email address and try again."
msgstr "Wala kaming nakitang application na tugma sa tracking code at email na iyan. Paki-check ang Tracking Code at email mo at subukan ulit."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "We emailed a verification code to your address. Enter it below to view your status."
msgstr "Nag-email kami ng verification code. Ilagay ito sa baba para makita ang status mo."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "This status link is no longer available. Use your Tracking Code and email to check your status."
msgstr "Hindi na gumagana ang status link na ito. Gamitin ang Tracking Code at email mo para ma-check ang status."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "This link is no longer available."
msgstr "Hindi na gumagana ang link na ito."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Verify your email again to continue."
msgstr "I-verify ulit ang email mo para ituloy."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Tick the box to confirm that you want to withdraw."
msgstr "I-check ang box para ma-confirm na gusto mong mag-withdraw."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Your request to withdraw was sent to the recruitment office. You will get an email once it is recorded."
msgstr "Naipadala na sa recruitment office ang withdrawal request mo. Makakatanggap ka ng email kapag na-record na ito."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "If this email has applications with us, we sent it a 6-digit code. Enter it below."
msgstr "Kung may application ang email na ito sa amin, nagpadala kami ng 6-digit code. Ilagay ito sa baba."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "This application could not be found."
msgstr "Hindi mahanap ang application na ito."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "There are no documents awaiting resubmission for this application."
msgstr "Walang documents na kailangang i-resubmit para sa application na ito."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "We could not start your application right now. Please try again in a few moments."
msgstr "Hindi namin masimulan ang application mo ngayon. Subukan ulit maya-maya."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "We could not send the verification code right now. Use Resend the code in a few moments."
msgstr "Hindi namin maipadala ang verification code ngayon. I-tap ang I-resend ang code maya-maya."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Choose a file to upload."
msgstr "Pumili ng file na ia-upload."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Your session ended. Reload the page and verify your email to continue."
msgstr "Na-end na ang session mo. I-reload ang page at i-verify ang email mo para ituloy."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "We could not send a verification code right now. Please try again in a few moments."
msgstr "Hindi kami makapagpadala ng verification code ngayon. Subukan ulit maya-maya."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Your application for %(title)s is not finished yet. Verify your email to continue, or use Resend the code if the code expired."
msgstr "Hindi pa tapos ang application mo para sa %(title)s. I-verify ang email mo para ituloy, o i-tap ang I-resend ang code kung nag-expire na ang code."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Not submitted yet"
msgstr "Hindi pa na-submit"

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "A verification code has been sent to your email address."
msgstr "Nagpadala kami ng verification code sa email mo."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Verify your email before resubmitting your documents."
msgstr "I-verify muna ang email mo bago i-resubmit ang documents mo."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Your documents have been resubmitted for review."
msgstr "Na-resubmit na ang documents mo para ma-review."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Where: %(place)s"
msgstr "Saan: %(place)s"

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Result: %(status)s"
msgstr "Resulta: %(status)s"

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Final decision"
msgstr "Final decision"

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Your application is with the office for the final decision."
msgstr "Nasa office na ang application mo para sa final decision."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "This application was already submitted."
msgstr "Na-submit na ang application na ito."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Choose a document to reuse."
msgstr "Pumili ng document na gagamitin ulit."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "We could not prepare a new verification code right now. Please try again in a few moments."
msgstr "Hindi kami makagawa ng bagong verification code ngayon. Subukan ulit maya-maya."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "If this email has applications with us, we sent it a new code."
msgstr "Kung may application ang email na ito sa amin, nagpadala kami ng bagong code."

#: recruitment/portal_views.py
msgid "Email verified. You can now re-upload the requested documents."
msgstr "Verified na ang email mo. Puwede mo nang i-upload ulit ang hinihinging documents."

#: recruitment/requirements.py
msgid "Upload the signed cover letter for this application."
msgstr "I-upload ang pirmadong cover letter para sa application na ito."

#: recruitment/requirements.py
msgid "Upload the completed Personal Data Sheet with the required photo attached."
msgstr "I-upload ang kumpletong Personal Data Sheet na may kasamang picture."

#: recruitment/requirements.py
msgid "Upload the Work Experience Sheet that accompanies the Personal Data Sheet."
msgstr "I-upload ang Work Experience Sheet na kasama ng Personal Data Sheet."

#: recruitment/requirements.py
msgid "Upload your latest performance rating only when you have an applicable rating for the last rating period."
msgstr "I-upload lang ang pinakabagong performance rating mo kung meron kang rating para sa huling rating period."

#: recruitment/requirements.py
msgid "Upload the eligibility, rating, or license document relevant to this application."
msgstr "I-upload ang eligibility, rating, o license mo na related sa application na ito."

#: recruitment/requirements.py
msgid "Upload the authenticated Transcript of Records."
msgstr "I-upload ang authenticated na Transcript of Records."

#: recruitment/requirements.py
msgid "Upload a copy of your diploma."
msgstr "Mag-upload ng kopya ng diploma mo."

#: recruitment/requirements.py
msgid "Upload your certificate or certificates of employment."
msgstr "I-upload ang certificate (o mga certificate) of employment mo."

#: recruitment/requirements.py
msgid "Upload your certificate or certificates for completed training courses."
msgstr "I-upload ang certificate (o mga certificate) ng mga natapos mong training."

#: recruitment/requirements.py
msgid "Upload the signed application letter for this COS application."
msgstr "I-upload ang pirmadong application letter para sa COS application na ito."

#: recruitment/requirements.py
msgid "Upload the eligibility, rating, or license document required for this COS application."
msgstr "I-upload ang eligibility, rating, o license na kailangan para sa COS application na ito."

#: recruitment/requirements.py
msgid "Upload a copy of your Transcript of Records."
msgstr "Mag-upload ng kopya ng Transcript of Records mo."

#: recruitment/requirements.py
msgid "Upload your training certificates when they apply to this COS application."
msgstr "I-upload ang training certificates mo kung kailangan para sa COS application na ito."

#: recruitment/services.py
msgid "DOH–CHD CALABARZON Recruitment Portal applicant verification code"
msgstr "DOH–CHD CALABARZON Recruitment Portal verification code"

#: recruitment/services.py
msgid ""
"DOH–CHD CALABARZON Recruitment Portal applicant verification code\n"
"\n"
"Your verification code is %(code)s.\n"
"It expires in %(minutes)s minutes.\n"
"\n"
"Do not share this code. DOH–CHD CALABARZON staff will never ask for it."
msgstr ""
"DOH–CHD CALABARZON Recruitment Portal verification code\n"
"\n"
"Ang verification code mo ay %(code)s.\n"
"Mag-e-expire ito sa loob ng %(minutes)s minuto.\n"
"\n"
"Huwag ibigay ang code na ito. Hindi ito hihingin ng staff ng DOH–CHD CALABARZON."

#: recruitment/services.py
msgid "Your application for %(title)s is not submitted yet"
msgstr "Hindi pa na-submit ang application mo para sa %(title)s"

#: recruitment/services.py
msgid ""
"Hello %(name)s,\n"
"\n"
"You started an application for %(title)s, but it has not been submitted yet. Applications close on %(date)s.\n"
"\n"
"Everything you added is saved. Open this link, enter the code we email you, and submit when your documents are ready:\n"
"%(link)s\n"
"\n"
"If you no longer wish to apply, you can ignore this email.\n"
"\n"
"DOH–CHD CALABARZON Recruitment Portal"
msgstr ""
"Hello %(name)s,\n"
"\n"
"Nagsimula ka ng application para sa %(title)s, pero hindi pa ito na-submit. Magsasara ang applications sa %(date)s.\n"
"\n"
"Naka-save lahat ng nailagay mo. Buksan ang link na ito, ilagay ang code na i-e-email namin, at i-submit kapag ready na ang documents mo:\n"
"%(link)s\n"
"\n"
"Kung ayaw mo nang mag-apply, puwede mong i-ignore ang email na ito.\n"
"\n"
"DOH–CHD CALABARZON Recruitment Portal"

#: recruitment/services.py
msgid "Reminder: send your corrected documents for %(title)s by %(date)s"
msgstr "Paalala: i-submit ang corrected documents mo para sa %(title)s hanggang %(date)s"

#: recruitment/services.py
msgid ""
"Hello %(name)s,\n"
"\n"
"The recruitment team is still waiting for the corrected documents for your application for %(title)s (Case No. %(case)s). Please send them on or before %(date)s.\n"
"\n"
"Open this link to see which documents and why, then upload them:\n"
"%(link)s\n"
"\n"
"DOH–CHD CALABARZON Recruitment Portal"
msgstr ""
"Hello %(name)s,\n"
"\n"
"Hinihintay pa rin ng recruitment team ang corrected documents para sa application mo sa %(title)s (Case No. %(case)s). Paki-submit hanggang %(date)s.\n"
"\n"
"Buksan ang link na ito para makita kung aling documents at bakit, tapos i-upload:\n"
"%(link)s\n"
"\n"
"DOH–CHD CALABARZON Recruitment Portal"

